OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks 'in crisis' amid fears
OL,4,Asome may have to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manager of a food bank in County
OL,7,FFermanagh has said they have enough
OL,8,Fmoney for "two months of running costs"
OL,9,Fbefore they run out, while another in
OL,10,Fwest Belfast has had to "significantly
OL,11,Freduce" the sizes of their parcels.
OL,13,FAccording to the Trussell Trust, an
OL,14,Fanti-poverty charity, some food banks
OL,15,Fare having pay for 30-50% of the food
OL,16,Fthey are supplying.
OL,18,FEnniskillen Foodbank said their ongoing
OL,19,Fexpenses were continuing and donations
OL,20,Fwere "not keeping pace" with project
OL,21,Fmanager Paul Dickson describing it as
OL,22,Fit a "bleak situation".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
